('111-4301-068','111-4301',68,'single_choice','In this case we are asked to reconsider Austin v. Michigan Chamber of Commerce, 494 U.S. 652 (1990). It has been noted that “Austin was a significant departure from ancient First Amendment principles.” We agree with that conclusion and hold that stare decisis does not compel the continued of Austin.','resistance','forbearance','disapproval','acceptance','法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],12,12,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
